<div class="container" style="padding-top: 30px; padding-bottom: 60px;">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-xs-12 col-md-10 col-md-offset-1">
      <div class="text-center" style="margin-bottom: 40px;">
        <h1 style="color: #e74c3c; font-weight: bold;">How to Play SportsBeep</h1>
        <p class="lead text-muted">Browse markets, review your wager, and track your bets.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="panel panel-default" style="margin-bottom: 25px;">
        <div class="panel-heading" style="background-color: #34495e; color: white;">
          <h3 class="panel-title">1. Create an account</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-body">
          <p><%= link_to 'Sign up', new_user_registration_path %> or log in to use account features. Participation is subject to age, location, and other applicable restrictions; check the <%= link_to 'Terms of Service', '/tos' %>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="panel panel-default" style="margin-bottom: 25px;">
        <div class="panel-heading" style="background-color: #34495e; color: white;">
          <h3 class="panel-title">2. Check your wallet and approved tokens</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-body">
          <p>Your <%= link_to 'Wallet', wallet_path %> shows account balances and transaction activity. A connected external wallet's holdings are not the same as your available in-app balance. Use the currently approved tokens shown in the app; review transaction status before wagering.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="panel panel-default" style="margin-bottom: 25px;">
        <div class="panel-heading" style="background-color: #34495e; color: white;">
          <h3 class="panel-title">3. Browse the sportsbook</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-body">
          <p>Visit the <%= link_to 'Sportsbook', sportsbook_path %> to browse available games and markets. Lines and displayed odds can change or become unavailable before a wager is submitted.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="panel panel-default" style="margin-bottom: 25px;">
        <div class="panel-heading" style="background-color: #34495e; color: white;">
          <h3 class="panel-title">4. Review and place a wager</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-body">
          <p>Select a market, then check the selection, odds, approved token, stake, and displayed potential return in the bet slip before submitting. Wagers involve risk of loss; displayed potential returns are not guaranteed.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="panel panel-default" style="margin-bottom: 25px;">
        <div class="panel-heading" style="background-color: #34495e; color: white;">
          <h3 class="panel-title">5. Track your bets</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-body">
          <p>Use <%= link_to 'My Bets', my_bets_path %> to review recorded wagers and their current status. A game ending does not by itself mean a wager has been settled or a payout has been credited. Contact support@sportsbeep.com if a result or transaction needs review.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>